meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{masterToken}}
}

docs {
  Sign-up, sign-in, OTP and token calls.
  
  > **From another app:** every request here except **Company code** belongs to **employee_app**, not implementor. Its code, fields and errors are owned by the employee_app team. The app calls it through `@erpgulf/auth-sdk`.
  
  Auth for this folder is the **master token** (`{{masterToken}}`), not a user token. **Company code** and **Refresh token** send no token. **Master Token** sends the user's `{{token}}`.
  
  Passwords and refresh tokens come from `.env` (`PASSWORD`, `REFRESH_TOKEN`). Mobile numbers and OTPs in the bodies are test values.
  
  Flow: Company code → Master Token → Employee policy → Sign up / Sign in (with OTP) → store tokens → Refresh token before expiry. Cold Boot policy runs on app restart.
}
